  "lore": {
    "summary": "Five storeys and 24,852 m2 of paper, 138 m from the Administrative Block and subordinate to it in every way that matters. Establishment means the list of who exists: every candidate, every posting, every screening result, filed by somebody who has never met any of them.\n\nPromoted at `sketch` depth on 2026-09-22 with no scene attached yet. It exists because the campaign is about an institution that reads your file, and the file has to be somewhere.",
    "playerFacing": "A building with more windows than doors. Trolleys in the corridors, and a smell of dry paper that gets into your clothes if you are in it for more than an hour.",
    "gmOnly": "NOT YET CAST IN ANY SCENE. Do not build a beat here without raising it first -- see design/approvals-desk.md's rule that content enters review only when a scheduled scene casts it. It is here so that 'where is my file?' has an answer when somebody finally asks."
  },
